
# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary, <= 50 chars, no trailing period>
#
# type:  feat | fix | build | docs | refactor | perf | test | chore | ci | style | revert
# scope: startup | kernel | servers | tools | run | agents | docs
#
# Body (optional, two to four lines is plenty): explain WHY, not what the diff
# already shows.  Wrap at 72.
# Keep one blank line between the summary, the body and any footer.
#
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Closes #12, Refs: ...
#
# Every commit must build:  ./run.sh --32 all
